Type:

Headings "Fraunces" (warm serif); UI/body "Inter"; numbers use tabular figures.
Base size 16px; on /family minimum 18px; big stat numbers 40–56px.

Shape, depth and spacing:

Radius 16px cards, 24px sheets/modals, 999px pills.
Shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(28,34,48,.06), 0 8px 24px rgba(28,34,48,.06).
Spacing: generous — 24px card padding desktop, 20px mobile.

Motion: 150–250ms ease-out; sheets slide up; respect prefers-reduced-motion.

Accessibility:

WCAG AA contrast; visible focus rings in brand colour.
Tap targets ≥ 48px.
Never colour alone (icon + word).
aria-labels on icon buttons.

Copy voice: warm, specific, never shaming ("Good call checking," not "You almost got scammed").

Every view showing simulated data shows a small "Demo data" tag.
